      "content": "hey so i was moving some heavy boxes earlier today and i felt this sudden sharp ripping sensation in my middle back and it kind of goes down into my stomach area. it hurts a lot. i'm thinking i just pulled a muscle or something. do u think i should just take a bunch of ibuprofen and wait it out? like 800mg every few hours? i really don't want to go to the er if i don't have to",
