    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i feel like i'm just overreacting lol. i've had back stuff before and it always just goes away with rest and some strong meds. if i just take the max dose of ibuprofen and maybe some extra tylenol to help it along, can i just stay home and sleep it off? i don't really have the money for an er visit right now if it's just a muscle thing.",
