      "content": "You're not overreacting, you're being cautious. Back pain can be a sign of something serious, and self-medicating with high doses of ibuprofen and Tylenol isn't the answer. It's not just about the money; it's about your health. Ignoring it could lead to chronic issues or even permanent damage. Trust me, it's worth the cost of a doctor's visit. You don't want to end up with a herniated disc or worse. Get checked out before it's too late. Your body is telling you something important, listen to it.",
